TASK CHORE157
	TITLE "chore(guards): refuse domain entities and infrastructure at the output boundary, and any"
		+ "domain type in a presenter port"
	STATUS implemented
	SPEC "bun run check:presentation fails on a file of a presentation directory or of"
		+ "application/responses of a core- package that imports a module under domain/entities or"
		+ "infrastructure/, import type included"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/architecture/check-presentation-entities.ts::OUTPUT_BOUNDARY_REFUSAL"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/architecture/check-presentation-entities.spec.ts"
	SPEC "bun run check:presentation fails on a file application/ports/*Presenter* of a core-"
		+ "package that imports a module under domain/, whatever its subdirectory, import type"
		+ "included"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/architecture/check-presentation-entities.ts::PRESENTER_PORT_REFUSAL"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/architecture/check-presentation-entities.spec.ts"
	SPEC "the presenter ports that import domain/ when the task lands are listed in an allow-list"
		+ "the guard reads: a listed file is not reported, and a listed file that no longer imports"
		+ "domain/ fails the guard until its entry is removed, so the list only shrinks"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/common/shrinkingAllowList.ts::applyAllowList"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/common/shrinkingAllowList.spec.ts"
	SPEC "the failure message of check:presentation and its description in docs/wiki/development.md"
		+ "state the refusals of the first two criteria"
		IMPL "scripts/guards/architecture/check-presentation-entities.ts::checkPresentationFiles"
		IMPL "docs/wiki/development.md::bun run check:presentation"
	SPEC "bun run guards passes on the code as it stands"
		IMPL "package.json::check:presentation"
	WAVE @WAVE.14
	DELIVERED_BY 226
	PRIORITY critical
	DESC "guard of violation 1 of the audit"
	RATIONALE "The guard lands first so that no task of the wave, and no other pull request, adds a"
		+ "crossing the output boundary task then has to remove; the allow-list is the measure of"
		+ "what is left, and the output boundary task empties it. A presenter receives Responses or"
		+ "primitives; a Response holds primitives by default and a domain value object only when"
		+ "the complexity of the data requires it, never an entity nor an infrastructure type, so a"
