	AFTER @TASK.REFACTOR161
	AFTER @TASK.REFACTOR162
	WAVE @WAVE.14
	DELIVERED_BY 238
	PRIORITY high
	DESC "outside the numbered violations of the audit"
	RATIONALE "A JSON table imported by a module is a database read by that module: the"
		+ "instructions rule data_reached_through_a_port places such a read in an infrastructure"
		+ "adapter behind a port of application/ports, and the owner ruled that the tables are"
		+ "external to the packages reading them, as a database is. The data- package is the driver"
		+ "of that database: its row types and selectors answer which rows and which value, by key"
		+ "or by order, and interpret nothing, so that the lookups shared-save-processing and the"
		+ "adapters share are written once; a rule naming a business outcome, resolving a declared"
		+ "version among others, stays in the domain. The port declares its own types so that a row"
		+ "type, the shape of the table, reaches neither the domain nor the application, the"
		+ "adapter translating. Seven tables exist today: the game releases, read by"
		+ "shared-save-processing; the energy levels, those of release 2.004, the planet names and"
		+ "the optimizer configuration, read by domain/ of core-mapping; the world object labels,"
		+ "read by presentation/; and the legacy terrain layer properties, read by no module and"
		+ "only validated, which move all the same. The packages are cut by the domain the tables"
		+ "serve, the energy tables kept together because the table of a release is validated"
		+ "against the energy table and both feed one rule. The labels follow the same flow,"
		+ "controller, use case, port, adapter, response, presenter, rather than a shortcut into"
		+ "presentation. The JSON Schemas stay in scripts/guards/validate-tables/ and each package"
		+ "names its tables in its validate:tables script until the guard task that follows"
		+ "discovers them. The tables move before the release rules task, which then puts the"
		+ "releases behind a port of its own, implemented with the selectors of data-save-format,"
		+ "instead of splitting the table between the domain and shared-save-processing. The wiki"
		+ "keeps the dependency matrix as the state of the project at implementation time, a trace"
		+ "that survives a pause during which the instructions evolve; the instructions rule on"
		+ "general statements is amended for it by the pull request that adds the package kind. The"
		+ "task follows the reader port task, which leaves the composition root instantiating only,"
		+ "so that the adapters are wired there once, and the decoding task, which rewrites the"
		+ "inputs of the entities this task hands the table values to, so that the two changes do"
		+ "not meet in a rebase"
		REF @TASK.REFACTOR163
		REF @TASK.REFACTOR161
		REF @TASK.REFACTOR162
		REF @TASK.CHORE169
		REF @DECISION.AValueTableIsAJsonFileBesideTheModuleThatReadsIt
	SOURCE "Owner ruling during the refinement of REFACTOR163, 2026-09-29: a JSON value table is a"
		+ "database, external to the packages that read it and read behind a port; the data-"
		+ "package provides the read contract, row types and selectors"
	SOURCE "Owner ruling during the refinement of the task, 2026-09-29: four data- packages cut by"
		+ "the domain the tables serve, the energy tables together; the port declares its own"
		+ "types; the guard discovers the tables of the data- packages in a task of its own; the"
