		PR 263
	SOURCE "Game assembly Assembly-CSharp.dll of release 2.103, Steam build 25296421, decompiled on"
		+ "2026-10-04: PlayerGaugesHandler raises the toxic value in a tracked ToxicArea at the"
		+ "toxic consumption rate times the share left to clean and 1 - v/100 for the Toxins Filter"
		+ "value v, caps it at ToxicArea.GetToxicTime, 10 by default, and drains it outside the"
		+ "area at the toxic remove rate times 1 + v/100; PlayerGaugeToxic draws the maximum less"
